invalid type: string "[Place: Okhla Bird Sanctuary | Section: 5. Quick Reference & Facts]\n## 5. Quick Reference & Facts\n* **Key Highlights:** Elevated watchtowers for birdwatching, shaded nature trails along the Yamuna riverbanks, seasonal migratory bird sightings, and photography points.\n* **Recommended Duration:** 2 to 3 hours (early morning hours yield maximum bird activity).\nx-ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ